# Landing pages

There is **one** marketing home. Do not reintroduce a separate `/compact` page.

## Canonical home

- File: `landing/index.html`
- URL: `/`
- Full scrollable page: hero + workspaces preview + feature sections + highlights + try CTA + footer
- This is what Google (and users) should see to understand what Hall is

## Legacy URLs

- `/compact` and `/compact.html` redirect to `/` (Firebase Hosting + Netlify)
- Do not add a second homepage variant unless explicitly asked

## Other pages

Separate routes (`/tarifs`, `/privacy`, `/terms`, `/auth`, etc.) stay as their own HTML files — those are not alternate homes.
